{{borrowing|en|have|lang=eo}}.

===Verb===
{{eo-verb|hav}}

# to [[have]]
#: {{usex|Mi '''havas''' elektran torĉon, sed mi ne '''havas''' bateriojn.|t=I '''have''' a flashlight, but I don't '''have''' batteries.|lang=eo}}

